    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">testŭla</span></b> , ae, f.
		dim.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a small potsherd.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 3,
				3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>An earthen lamp</i>, Ser. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Diom. p. 511</span></i> P. —
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A voting-tablet used by the Athenians</i>, <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Arist. 1, 2</span></i> (cf. testa, II. C.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
